### Latest Contracts API (آخر الصفقات)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### GET LATEST CONTRACTS (آخر الصفقات)
### ============================================
### Get the most recent contracts in the system
### Returns contracts ordered by creation date (newest first)
### 
### Requires: User authentication (JWT token)
### Query Parameters:
###   - limit: Number of contracts to return (default: 10, max: 100, min: 1)

GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/latest?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Example with custom limit:
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/latest?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Example with default limit (10):
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

