### }

### ============================================
### NOTES & GUIDELINES
### ============================================

### 1. AUTHENTICATION
###    - This endpoint requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header
###    - Format: Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>
###    - Get token from: POST /api/auth/verify-otp

### 2. QUERY PARAMETERS
###    - limit: Optional parameter to specify number of contracts to return
###      * Default: 10
###      * Minimum: 1
###      * Maximum: 100
###      * Values outside this range will be clamped to min/max

### 3. ORDERING
###    - Contracts are ordered by creation date in descending order (newest first)
###    - Uses the "createdAt" field for ordering

### 4. INCLUDED DATA
###    - Each contract includes:
###      * Client information with profile picture
###      * Proposal information
###      * Freelancer information with profile picture
###      * Reviewer information (if applicable)

### 5. USE CASES
###    - Dashboard: Display recent contracts
###    - Activity feed: Show latest contract activity
###    - Analytics: Track recent contract creation
###    - Public display: Show recent successful contracts (if made public)

### 6. PERFORMANCE
###    - The endpoint performs eager loading to avoid N+1 queries
###    - Limit should be kept reasonable (10-50) for best performance
###    - Consider caching if called frequently

###